------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADDITIONAL TERMS — bundled starter audio (does not replace the AGPL above)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The code and documentation in this repository remain AGPL-3.0-or-later.

A small starter drum kit is shipped under packs/starter/ (and inlined in
src/starter-pack-*.js). That audio is NOT an AETHER-ENGINEERS original.
It is a recompressed subset of the Sonic Pi etc/samples library, which
Sonic Pi dedicates to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
    https://github.com/sonic-pi-net/sonic-pi/blob/dev/etc/samples/README.md

CC0 audio may be copied, modified, and redistributed without permission.
Attribution is not required by CC0; we still record the full source map
in packs/starter/CREDITS.md so credits stay attached to the files.

The AGPL on this project's source code does not re-license those CC0
hits as AGPL, and the CC0 hits do not weaken the AGPL on the source.
Each work keeps its own terms.

If you replace or add samples, document them in packs/starter/CREDITS.md
(or a new packs/<name>/CREDITS.md) rather than deleting this section.
